NOTICE — third-party font software embedded in @openview/engine
===============================================================

`@openview/engine` embeds twelve TrueType faces so that a document prints the same
way on any machine. Nothing is fetched at build time or at render time: the bytes
below are part of the published package, and no font of the host is ever consulted.

Each file is pinned by upstream release, byte length and SHA-256. The pins live in
`tools/fonts/sources.mjs`; `packages/engine/src/document/fonts/__tests__/integrity.test.ts`
re-derives the length, the digest, the names and the character coverage from the
embedded bytes at every run, so a substituted file fails the build.

